   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent Repository + Oracle Always Free Compute, subject to tenancy/region/capacity verification"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c7420a98-efe1-4c3b-ab5b-13a0488ec6d5",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent GitLab/Bitbucket Repository + independent compute"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f06293ce-b413-4bb4-b1b4-ca2d03ec8885",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Comparison / Decision"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e089b7a6-876b-48dc-b35d-d795325f24b5",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "NEW CANDIDATE: Cloudflare-native Durable Runtime substrate"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "374c7951-adaf-4530-877d-49f9b608d623",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "The combination of Durable Objects + Queues + Workflows is materially stronger than the previously evaluated Workflows-only architecture for the stated requirements:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "31aa6105-92ce-49ed-ade5-73caafed8451",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Durable state / coordination: Durable Objects SQLite"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "db2adcb6-b9e5-48f1-934d-a80108ec41fa",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Durable queue / delivery: Queues"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "568c8301-eaff-4125-9284-7e300bfb772f",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Orchestration / retries / long-running workflow state: Workflows"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "41bc0568-184e-4d8e-a56e-0f06ee0dc490",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "DLQ / retry support: Queues"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "862ef2a4-7bba-4f54-9458-dc10ac5fd5af",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Ownership / serialization primitives: Durable Objects"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "fb1359c1-565f-4cd8-adf2-120fc7a5310f",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "However, this does not remove the primary blocker: an independently owned repository and verified deployment path are still required."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "355a7f88-ccc7-4530-a850-8b5e7d483490",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Decision"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d37d4a79-1aa7-471d-a9ef-573187fb8401",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "KEEP REPOSITORY ISOLATION GATE"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "142e2038-7535-4413-a5d0-0832d4f97d83",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not use or modify Umm-sara, main, or umm-sarah-web as Central Runtime infrastructure."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "b3b6fb99-d502-4024-a2ec-e5c8a6678699",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not provision paid resources without explicit authorization."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "74c32441-840b-4832-879d-c63e6da90bb7",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Architecture direction updated: if repository/deployment isolation becomes available, evaluate Cloudflare-native Durable Objects + Queues + Workflows as the first implementation candidate instead of treating Workflows alone as the complete Runtime."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "37c4b3f6-257a-4b6c-9492-96656d593fc2",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Side-Effect Check"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "879dac2a-e496-48f2-914c-40a7ccf9c50f",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "No safe in-scope infrastructure mutation is available in this run."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "55597663-c773-4d8a-936b-4a546558775a",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Repository creation is not exposed by the connected GitHub tools."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a2f1decf-5e08-47c2-97fd-94d98b5cc23a",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Cloudflare account/deployment tools are not currently connected."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "30cbbbeb-bac0-4c31-a15c-a7a47c8f4000",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Paid provisioning is not authorized."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "05b4a7e2-b5f2-402f-82aa-581b3e8a9ff1",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Business repository use would violate the isolation requirement."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "6d89a060-3e39-4111-9670-0c9152ada1e5",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Fix Applied"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "27e9779a-d3a3-4b68-909d-cf9b9c86be53",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Read-only reconciliation + fresh independent research + architecture candidate update only."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f22a60f9-1e2c-4f3b-bbf0-1991dee2a84f",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "No business repository mutation. No branch mutation. No paid-resource creation. No deployment."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T05:04:00.000Z"
  },
